  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PPG-Accelerating Nature and Climate Action to Advance Nigeria&#x2019;s Net Zero and &#x2018;30x30&#x2019;Targets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Global Environmental Fund Project Preparatory Grant is to develop the project concept :Accelerating Nature and Climate Action to Advance Nigeria&#x2019;s Net Zero and &#x2018;30x30&#x2019;Targets in Nigeria into a full project. As described in the project concept and in line with Nigeria&#x2019;s commitment to carbon neutrality by 2060, the project takes an integrated approach to create a Net Zero Nature Positive pathway and to achieve large-scale emission reductions in the energy and AFOLU sectors, which together account for 85% of Nigeria&#x2019;s GHG emissions</narrative>
  </description>
